+\subsection{Results and evidence boundary}
+The convention is unchanged:
+\begin{equation}
+ \epsilon=2s-d,\qquad
+ \Delta_{\mathcal E}(d,\epsilon)
+   =\frac{d-\epsilon}{2}+\gamma_r(g_*(\epsilon),\epsilon)
+   =\sum_{n=0}^{6}C_n(d)\epsilon^n+O(\epsilon^7).
+ \label{prec:convention}
+\end{equation}
+This appendix refines the numerical integration of the complete physical
+combination already derived in Appendices U and V.  It is not a new
+primitive-only estimate, interpolation in dimension, or prediction from
+lower-order coefficients.  The retained power-subgraph corrections and
+critical-mass prescription are unchanged.  Their previous audits are
